Subject: [PATCH 0005/0012] make the stream window a window the user can drive

The stream surface is a real top-level: F11 toggles it between the windowed
frame and the whole output, closing it stops the stream instead of leaving a
black rectangle, and the keyboard (F11, the frame dump) keeps working while the
video is on top. The interface underneath stops repainting what the window
covers, and a timer pulls frames from the interface thread so the video rate no
longer follows the interface's repaint rate.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [STM32MP25 performance work]

